  "notes": "Announced at Google I/O on 2024-05-14 and released on 2024-06-27 in 9B and 27B sizes; the 2B size followed on 2024-07-31 together with ShieldGemma and Gemma Scope. The successor link to Gemma 1.1 is editorial: no source names Gemma 2 as the successor of Gemma 1.1 specifically, although the technical report builds on Gemma 1.1 post-training and compares with it. Parameter values are the announced size labels (qualifier approximate); the exact counts are in the variant notes."
